        "slc_48233a33b7569b20c640070a33ce2037d89139dbb2e76fd189193e1545f2bdde"
      ],
      "text": "Non-interactive use is supported via atomic -p \"<prompt>\", which prints the response and exits; provider credentials are stored in ~/.atomic/agent/auth.json with owner-only permissions where the platform supports them."
    },
