        "slc_6e1c51f3f724898304a9db21af1fac3cc336face09b362df99c520214f2466cb"
      ],
      "text": "Atomic has no built-in sandbox or command-level shell permission gate; tools and extensions run with the user's permissions, and the README recommends running autonomous work in a devcontainer, VM, or remote machine."
    },
